  "description": "Application under s 73 to vary condition 2 (Approved plans), condition 17 (materials), Condition 18 (construction detailing), Condition 26 (wheelchair accessible housing), Condition 37 (Bird and Bat Boxes), Condition 52 (vehicular access road), Condition 53 (Waste Transfer Unit Visibility Splays) of Planning Permission ref: 17/00605/FUL.\r\rOriginal description of development for 17/00605/FUL (as amended by application ref: 20/02186/NMC granted 24/07/2020):\r\rDemolition of the existing buildings and the re-development of the site incorporating the erection of six buildings comprised of basement and lower ground floor levels, ranging from four to 10 storeys above ground, landscaped gardens, public square, car parking and associated works; for a mixed use scheme comprised of a waste transfer facility at basement level, B1 office accommodation and A3 café; and the provision of residential units granted on 29.03.2018.\r\rAmendments sought include: \rReduction in overall height in buildings A, B, C and D with exception of three areas -  middle of building A, book end of building C and Building D,\rRationalisation of the ceiling voids and reduction in floor to ceiling heights within all buildings to facilitate additional floors within buildings C, D, E and F,\rRelocation of 6 residential units from level 02 and 9 residential units from level 03 of building E, relocated to building C and D, \rAmendments to elevations and internal layouts of all buildings,\rAdditional 4,429sqm flexible Office space (E(g)(i) created (Building E and F). Including plant on Building F relocated and replaced with additional floor for office use,\rAlterations and Extensions to Buildings E & F including extensions to floors 1-5,\rSite levels altered across,\rBasement reduced and Car parking spaces reduced from 38 to 32,\t\rReduction in size of Waste Transfer facility from 1196sqm (GIA) to 1164sqm (as approved).",
